  <h3 style="color:#232739;margin-top:40px;">Aiper vs. a Weekly Pool Service: The Real Cost Over Time</h3>

  <p>A weekly pool cleaning service typically runs $75 to $150 a month depending on region and pool size, before spring opening or fall closing fees. Over a single pool season, that's frequently $600 to $1,200, recurring every year for as long as you own the pool. An Aiper cleaner is a one-time purchase that keeps working season after season, with only the electricity to recharge it as an ongoing cost.</p>

